{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "55903f7083f38a552a6cd6dad094ff57ab2ce4eedfe71390e5e4ca2647036e13", "ja": "そのままの君でいて", "zh": "保持原本的你就好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8851804ababa0f37e49c445804beb66f0738b0c13ccb181b4b27fd1a5fa73980", "ja": "ショーとライブが終了。真剣勝負ではあるが\nひとまず成功を喜び合う中、莉緒が「地雷系\nの本質を掴んだかも」と言い出す。いつもと\n変わらない言動を見て「安心した」と言う\nメンバーとプロデューサーだった。", "zh": "演出和演唱会结束了。虽然是认真的较量，  \n大家暂且为成功而欢欣时，莉绪却说自己  \n“好像抓住了地雷系的本质”。看到她一如既往  \n的言行，成员们和制作人都说“放心了”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c836df75f29fc2b38b4385a39ba84684fb7fad567da44cd80c19ddc28aaf49e7", "ja": "（ショーとライブは大盛況！　真剣勝負ではあるけど、\n今くらいは、この喜びを分かち合いたいな）", "zh": "（演出和演唱会大获成功！虽然是认真的较量，\n但至少现在，我还是想和大家一起分享这份喜悦）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "167a964005c18c2f7fecb227a298da415c1e5d8a3900eeb8c2292db5f4b096a4", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　ファッションショーの\nライブに相応しい、華のあるステージだった！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！不愧是时装秀的\n演出，真是个绚丽夺目的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "0a9988dc47f0a506d5c0854bdbf9ff11ecc3369deced6607d94c482a88ac637b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nお疲れさまです～。やりましたよ～、むふふ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了～。我们做到了哦～，唔呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "d636bd635d6befc250c45f8106368ed1192606f04edd103d70e53756d1ba3b35", "ja": "お客さんの反応、とってもよかったです～。\n手ごたえあり、ですな～♪", "zh": "观众的反应特别好～  \n看来很有成效呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "d2f15e917c0407d6f8d2e8ad67be696be5dc2227052852ee0077401de0d524ac", "ja": "あふぅ……ミキ、けっこーがんばったから眠いの～。\n{$P$}、もう寝てもいーい？", "zh": "哈啊……美希挺努力的，所以好困哦～。\n{$P$}，美希现在可以睡了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c979542706e8cc85566c570fb8e5d685e0faea38ec80f11b7b007bc505a7fd5b", "ja": "もう少しだけ頑張ってくれ。せめて着替えるまで。", "zh": "再坚持一下。至少换好衣服再睡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "00af7dcd35b45dfc4eda95c4825ed58264d858e260b3d587a102e40bb4c4e350", "ja": "ふぅ、やっぱライブっていいな！\nファッションショーも、まあ、悪くはなかったけど……", "zh": "呼……果然还是现场演出好啊！\n时装秀嘛，倒也不能说不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "72bc52634eb4fe2e0d9674ff168ccf18ae6e0a1d703d571a9dd75f5f4f328ed9", "ja": "あたしとしては、ライブでどれだけ巻き返せたか\n気になるところだ。ショーの方は、莉緒姉がな……。", "zh": "对我来说，比较在意的是在演唱会上扳回了多少局面。\n至于时装秀嘛，莉绪姐她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "b6165b621e625dfb8918d2c0cf0befd6ef91d59f12703bb61bc5d53d6c394267", "ja": "そうね……自分でもビックリしちゃったわ。\n{$P$}くん、ちゃんと見てた？", "zh": "是啊……连我自己都吓了一跳。\n{$P$}，你有好好看着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "cb75ab7c9ec8b075f425bfe06d6a155a539292f401e0c9bf637f8641cd4ba4d2", "ja": "みんなの食いつき、すごかったわ～！\n視線が、私に釘付けなの……！", "zh": "大家被吸引得可牢了～！\n视线完全钉在我身上呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c55f432bbaef9a2dc98b481866fc37b4bfeb7ac21307d86cc516f46c32c8ce4c", "ja": "もちろん見てたよ。上手いこと狙いが\nハマってたみたいでよかった。", "zh": "我当然在看啊。预期的效果似乎\n很好地呈现出来了，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "d2b518e7d54c692f658f15c1321355a2bcf6397f5960bb5d6c802192d0e8da6d", "ja": "むぅ……{$P$}？\nミキだって、莉緒に負けてなかったでしょ？", "zh": "唔……{$P$}？\n美希也没有输给莉绪吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3a09de186327824fcd9b40f2ca55ffd4c02a670794b6410c6e9c0abe4e818046", "ja": "もちろん。みんなの視線を奪ってたと思うよ。\n流石だな、美希！", "zh": "当然。我觉得你吸引了大家的视线。\n不愧是美希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "f39c5b8824978cd0e17879b2124d63d15aafc19377e46e00ade56b37bb9c8408", "ja": "最初はどうなることかと思ったけど……みんなの\nお陰で私、地雷系の本質を掴んだかもしれないわ……！", "zh": "一开始还不知道会怎样……但托大家的福，我好像抓住了地雷系的本质……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "bc4237abd57f2b79347a5abe32816a8e53c5c4e8402936747da304c3ed0faf41", "ja": "地雷系の……？", "zh": "地雷系的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "8df128e46d56d369b7da63783acb478a1488bc8a4e07179276af8824aae4684a", "ja": "本質……？", "zh": "本质……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "67a40d3cbf639ce659a5086b9c82a95d5546bb7ced082c646fcdc7f53f2dbe48", "ja": "つまり、「恥ずかしい」……ってことだと思うの！\n特別に見せてあげるわね！　コホン……。", "zh": "也就是说，我觉得这就是“害羞”……吧！\n那我就特别给你看看哦！咳咳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "7e15027d011d5ce1a37772216eaac4bce499547da92bfaa18338a903b0f43348", "ja": "いや～っ、恥ずかしいじゃない……んもうっ！\nそんなに見ちゃ、ダ・メ・よ～♪", "zh": "不要一直盯着看嘛～人家会害羞的……真是的！\n不·可·以·看·得·那·么·仔·细·哟～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "7c6df1a503ce09cfa7c7c9475ffb566a9c85a0d03c6403e6bd840afdafaf0432", "ja": "どうどう！？　ドキドキしちゃったでしょ、\n{$P$}くん！", "zh": "怎么样！？心跳加速了吧，{$P$}君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "36eded2097f2b9624fa08d4f4e7ddcc8dffa0b46f0aa9764f07abe3440589cb5", "ja": "……うん、まあ……お疲れさま。", "zh": "……嗯，那个……辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "3a918efb013255a23f455a42e6f4d1a6d54be3f0a80984dc5bb5b9dfeefda85a", "ja": "あ、あら？　なによ{$P$}くん、\nその微妙な反応～～！？", "zh": "啊、哎呀？怎么了，{$P$}，你这反应也太微妙了吧～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "ecaea5553b27537f1b0d81ab6acb61c3d2b579bf0d7183081fa2f49311f83d7a", "ja": "ふぅ……やっぱ、莉緒姉は莉緒姉だな。\nなんていうか、安心したよ。", "zh": "呼……果然莉绪姐还是莉绪姐啊。该怎么说呢，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "6bbc74cc514b419eb1e64e33cecb781cb76ec4e42d437b15e60f56526161143f", "ja": "わからないままステージに出て、正解だったかも？", "zh": "就这么懵懵懂懂地上台，说不定反而是正确的选择？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "5e378a139fd3109284fc3485c146d4a1f6ccb99af2f6082007c439312743879b", "ja": "こういうところが、\n莉緒さんの魅力なんだと思いますよ～。", "zh": "我觉得，这种地方正是莉绪姐的魅力所在哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "5e17f131d5d5159705614f4cd5283eddb1c3707b7670780b19b8140f99780c95", "ja": "ええーっ！？　なになに！？　私、何か間違ってた？\n教えてよみんな、ねえ！　ねえってばーっ！", "zh": "诶——！？怎么了怎么了！？我刚才做错什么了吗？\n大家告诉我嘛，拜托！喂——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "f2b7b24ab618e10b2f646172555972af7d0f803e59397db533b5275256db9fbc", "ja": "ねえ{$P$}。お仕事は\n大成功だったんだから、打ち上げ、期待していーよね？", "zh": "呐，{$P$}。工作大获成功，庆功宴可以期待一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "3f2a05719fceb8172d877db87654b6affdb3e2d0fe2c03920d9155c169f70157", "ja": "ミキ、回らないおにぎりがいいな～。", "zh": "美希想要不会转的饭团～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "26b70ac91ac4b3a3093891fba0cbc0e244db5266fd174912a267f2fd9a7168c2", "ja": "おにぎりは回らない気がするけど……\nそうだな、とっておきのお店を探そう！", "zh": "我觉得饭团应该不会转吧……\n好，那就去找一家珍藏的店吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0dd450ce5b1eadb1df11b09f7331dee7be1ab4d9bad594665bd395b601b3fac9", "ja": "（なんていうか……わからないままでも勝負できる\nというのは、莉緒のポテンシャルの高さなんだろうな）", "zh": "（怎么说呢……即使在什么都不明白的情况下也能较量，看来这就是莉绪潜力之高吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a6698890afd32e6f2a6bece21155a2910d8aebc383b8e4a0dea363c4b90cbf16", "ja": "（今回も、いい勝負になったんじゃないかな。\nさて、次のBOTに向けて、企画を考えないと）", "zh": "（这次应该也算是势均力敌吧。好了，得为下一场BOT比赛想想企划了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
